# Tasks

Purpose:
  Task lifecycle engine. Defines how tasks are created, assigned,
  executed, reviewed, and closed within the SDDRA system.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1 @INDEX.sdd
   2 @tasks.sdd (task lifecycle rules and contracts)
   3 @decomposition.sdd (decomposition engine and validation)

Rules:
  [T1] Every task MUST have a unique ID.
  [T2] Tasks MUST be assigned to specific stages.
  [T3] Task status MUST be tracked: pending -> active -> done.
  [T4] Task dependencies MUST be resolved before execution.

Navigation:
  Tasks: @tasks.sdd
  Decomposition: @decomposition.sdd
  ProjectTasks: @../projects/vkard.az/tasks/INDEX.sdd

State: +
